  "details": "Unity 2019.4.31f1\n\nVRC SDK Base, World: 3.4.2\n\nI've encountered an issue where an incorrect vrcw file gets uploaded.\n\nBecause build and upload processes being separate, the upload does not halt even when a build fails.\n\nAs a result, the previously built asset bundle (vrcw) gets uploaded in case of a build failure.\n\nThis issue becomes particularly problematic immediately after switching platforms.\n\nFor instance, an Android build was uploaded as a Windows build, resulting in a situation where no Windows users were able to enter the world.",
